    "updated_at": "2017-05-23T03:32:17Z",
    "body": "> If Firefox and IE don't support that syntax, perhaps we can get away with it?\r\n\r\nI think they do support it. (FWIW, `;utf8` doesn't do anything. If you specified `;charset=...` you might see some differences.)",
